HunyuanOCR 1.5 runtime attribution
===================================

This adapter is a thin Vonk artifact-job wrapper around Tencent's official
HunyuanOCR 1.5 inference toolkit at commit
1ef4179e53cf860f7e6fd8276a292e5d05b3e927. The image preserves the official
task prompts, greedy sampling settings, tail-repetition protection,
document-Markdown normalization, and lossless DFlash speculative decoding.

Upstream source: https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/HunyuanOCR
Model source: https://huggingface.co/tencent/HunyuanOCR
vLLM deployment recipe: https://recipes.vllm.ai/tencent/HunyuanOCR

